00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:45.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
KRISTINA MICHAUD, députée, BQ,

00:00:43.844 --> 00:00:46.580 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Avignon-La Mitis-Matane

00:00:44.845 --> 00:00:48.615 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais un plan de réduction qui

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.650 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne nous permet pas de plafonner

00:00:46.914 --> 00:00:52.419 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la production, ou du moins<c.colorF000F0>(-de s</c>

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:53.420 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un avenir rapproché, bien, ce

00:00:49.984 --> 00:00:54.455 size:53% position:73% line:53%
